## 2. Cleanup Checklist

- [ ] README.md is complete.
- [ ] SRS.md reflects the final implementation.
- [ ] DEPLOY.md contains deployment instructions.
- [ ] QA test cases are included.
- [ ] QA report is updated.
- [ ] Deployment report is included.
- [ ] `.env.example` contains variable names without real secrets.
- [ ] `.gitignore` excludes `.env` and `node_modules`.
- [ ] No API keys or passwords are committed.
- [ ] Unnecessary temporary files are removed.
- [ ] Merged branches are reviewed and deleted where appropriate.
- [ ] Main branch protection is configured if available.
- [ ] Repository can be cloned and understood by an outside reader.

